{"id": "EUVD-2026-59734", "enisaUuid": "62c32fb6-9784-3b9a-a16c-2a486922d8a0", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: ISO: clear iso_data always when detaching conn from hcon\n\nWhen setting conn->hcon = NULL, also conn->hcon->iso_data = NULL is\nnecessary, otherwise later iso_conn_free() will UAF.\n\nFix clearing of iso_data in iso_sock_disconn()\n\nFixes KASAN: slab-use-after-free in iso_conn_hold_unless_zero on\niso_sock_release() followed by hci_abort_conn_sync().", "datePublished": "2026-08-15T12:27:52", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T19:05:54", "baseScore": 8.8, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cc1d39946d62bc568551dfb81149724de1e91338", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7b51a9c25e9698b64df9f2218f10eecf7dc7e2d0", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/63c0f396a18b767eb28e895eb95bbdce6c172c59", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/69a4a7b162b3db6ac337e3094cdee38f24d42ff7", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d57e506f6a1e3929611340fae87c1e4823f4d85c"], "aliases": ["GHSA-jwr7-m8vx-rqm4", "CVE-2026-74541"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "21a1332a-ff8d-312f-a98d-c14d2faca263", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.6"}, {"id": "2f58af5b-186d-3dd4-be5f-eebb916604c3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2"}, {"id": "379d497b-ade6-3ac0-bb00-b51fa2a99784", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.1.8"}, {"id": "4d7515ba-aac6-35bc-86aa-ee4ccaefa02b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.103"}, {"id": "649ce2f0-bcde-3402-b241-0c400bd462f6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.5.12 <6.6"}, {"id": "716efb4a-03c8-32bb-8d3e-5a17e22bc438", "product": {"name": "Lin